Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:37.59,Screen,,0,0,0,,{=230}{\alpha&H00&\fn方正兰亭中黑_GBK\fs60\an8\bord4\xshad0\c&HFFECFF&\3c&H601BFE&\4c&HFEFEFE&\b1\frz28.6\pos(1728.04,380.38)}安庆喵{\c&HFFCD4E&\3c&H2A0B19&}的机会
